# written from the documentation, provisional: inside sbatch -N4, srun -N2 -r2
# runs on pi-003 and pi-004. SLURM_NODELIST is the job's four hosts, and
# SLURM_NODEID=0 indexes the step's: node 0 is pi-003, which only
# SLURM_STEP_NODELIST says (§6.1).
# expect: launcher=SLURM_ rank=0 size=2 node=0 nodes=2 local=0/1 gtids=0 job=1234 step=1 hosts=pi-[003-004]
SLURM_JOB_ID=1234
SLURM_STEP_ID=1
SLURM_PROCID=0
SLURM_LOCALID=0
SLURM_NODEID=0
SLURM_STEP_NUM_TASKS=2
SLURM_STEP_NUM_NODES=2
SLURM_STEP_NODELIST=pi-[003-004]
SLURM_GTIDS=0
SLURM_NODELIST=pi-[001-004]
SLURM_JOB_NODELIST=pi-[001-004]
